5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! I'm going to find that werewolf no matter what. Since we don't have any clues yet, let's just talk and see who's acting weird. Does anyone have a plan?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"I believe a patient approach is best, Takumi. Let us simply observe one another and listen carefully. In my experience, those who rush to lead often reveal more than they intend. I shall be watching.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so excited to play with everyone! I agree with George, let's just be friendly and get to know each other first. I'm sure if we all work together, we can find the wolf! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with George. Rushing into accusations without evidence is counterproductive. Let's maintain a calm atmosphere and observe how everyone interacts before we draw any conclusions.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready too! This is like a big mystery adventure, right? I'm going to use my super-detective instincts to find the werewolf! Let's make this really exciting! Who do you think is the most suspicious so far?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Rin, it's way too early to pick someone! We have to be smart about this. I'm not just rushing; I'm making sure we don't miss anything. @George, @Misaki, you're both being very quiet. Is that your plan?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Observation is not the same as silence, Takumi. I am listening to the tone and rhythm of our conversation. I prefer to step back and see the full picture before I offer a judgment.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, don't be too hard on them! I think it's nice that George and Misaki are being so thoughtful. I'm just happy we're all talking! Maybe we can share something we like to make it more fun?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, being quiet is simply my way of processing the information. I believe it is more effective to listen than to speak without a purpose. I am paying close attention to everyone's reactions.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're so grumpy! Hehe! I think it's like a spy movie where the quiet people are the most mysterious. @Yumi, that's a great idea! I love drawing and adventures! What about you guys?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't have time for hobbies right now, Rin! We're in the middle of a game. @Yumi, you're too nice. We can't just be friendly; the wolf is pretending to be our friend right now! We need to stay sharp.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"Takumi, your vigilance is commendable, but do not let it turn into agitation. A sharp mind is most effective when it is calm. Let us not mistake friendliness for weakness, nor caution for indifference.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, I know you're just trying to protect us, and I really appreciate that! But I think being kind helps us trust each other more. If we're all happy, it'll be easier to spot something that feels wrong!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, while kindness is a virtue, we must remember that trust is a tool that can be exploited. I agree with Takumi that we should remain vigilant, but George is right that agitation only clouds our judgment.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, you're so smart! It's like a puzzle where the pieces are people! But @Takumi, you're acting like a scary teacher! Hehe! I'll be a super-detective and watch for anyone who's *too* nice or *too* grumpy!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not a scary teacher, Rin! I'm just the only one taking this seriously! Fine, let's observe for now, but I'm not letting my guard down. I'll see you all tomorrow.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,I agree. Let us conclude today's discussion with a sense of composure. I shall spend the night reflecting on our initial interactions. I wish you all a peaceful evening.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams and wake up feeling refreshed tomorrow. I'm really looking forward to seeing you all again! Let's all stay safe! Hehe!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Goodnight, everyone. I hope we all have a restful sleep. I will be reflecting on our conversation tonight to see if any patterns emerge. See you all tomorrow.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to dream about catching the werewolf in a giant net! Hehe! I'll be super-ready for tomorrow's clues! See you all in the morning! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
