36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Good morning! The first night is over, and I've got some information. @George is human, so we can trust him for now. Now, let's see if anyone else has noticed anything suspicious or wants to speak up!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"@Takumi, that is a very bold claim to make so early. If you are the Seer, you have provided us with a helpful anchor. However, I must wonder why you chose to reveal this immediately.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, Takumi! That's amazing! If you're the Seer, you're like a superhero for the village! Hehe! @George, I'm so glad you're human! Now we can all feel a little bit safer, right?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, claiming the Seer role and clearing George so quickly is a high-risk strategy. While it provides a lead, it also makes you a primary target. Are you officially claiming the Seer role, or is this a tactical move?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're the superhero! Hehe! But @Misaki is right, it's a bit scary to tell everyone so soon! Are you really the Seer, or are you just playing a trick on us? I'm so curious!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm officially claiming the Seer role! I'm not playing tricks. I revealed it now because we need a solid start, and I'm not afraid of the wolf. @Misaki, @Rin, I'm doing this to protect everyone!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"Your courage is noted, Takumi, but bravery without caution can be reckless. By exposing yourself, you have given the werewolf a clear target. I hope your claim is truthful, for the sake of our survival.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, you're so brave! It's really kind of you to put yourself in danger just to help us. I believe you! Let's all do our best to protect our superhero Seer! Hehe!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, your willingness to sacrifice your safety is noted. However, we must remain objective. If you are the Seer, we have a confirmed human in George. If not, you've just secured George's trust. @George, how do you feel about this?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@George, do you feel like a superhero's sidekick now? Hehe! But @Misaki is always so serious! If Takumi is lying, he's a very naughty wolf! Do you think he's telling the truth, George? I want to know!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@George, you don't have to be so worried about me! I can handle myself. I'm telling the truth, and I'm not going to let the wolf scare me into staying silent while we're all in danger!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"I appreciate your confidence, Takumi, but my concern is for the village, not myself. While I am grateful for the clearance, I cannot blindly trust a claim without seeing how it holds up. We must remain vigilant.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@George, you're so thoughtful! It's okay to be a little careful, but I think Takumi's heart is in the right place. Let's try to be positive and support each other! Who else feels like they've seen something suspicious? Hehe!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, positivity is helpful, but we cannot ignore the possibility of a fake claim. If Takumi is the werewolf, he has just created a powerful alliance with George. We should observe if any counter-claims emerge before we fully commit.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, you're always thinking about the scary parts! But if Takumi is a naughty wolf, why would he make himself a target? That's a silly plan! I think he's really the superhero! Does anyone else think he's lying? Hehe!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not a naughty wolf, Rin! And @Misaki, there are no counter-claims because I'm the real Seer! We can't waste time doubting me. Let's focus on the others. Who do you guys suspect? I'm ready to vote!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"Since no one has challenged Takumi's claim, we have a lead, but we must not let it blind us. I suspect the wolf may be hiding behind a mask of extreme innocence or neutrality. Let us vote with caution.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I don't want to suspect anyone because you're all so nice! But if we have to, maybe we should trust Takumi's lead? I'm just a bit scared of making a mistake! What do you think, @Misaki, @Rin? Hehe!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, it is difficult to choose when we lack concrete evidence. However, if we trust Takumi's claim, we must look at those who haven't been cleared. I find George's neutrality cautious, but not necessarily suspicious. I'll reserve my vote for now.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't want to pick anyone because we're all friends! But if Takumi is the superhero, we have to find the bad guy! Maybe the wolf is just pretending to be super quiet? I'll trust my detective heart! Hehe!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
