69,2,1,talk,George,,"It is a tragedy that we have lost Misaki. However, the fact that Takumi was attacked last night is a significant development. It strongly suggests that Takumi is indeed the Seer, as the werewolf would want to eliminate our most valuable asset.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no, Misaki is gone! I'm so sad! But @George is right, it's so scary that Takumi was attacked! That must mean he's really our superhero Seer! Are you okay, Takumi? I'm so worried about you! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, are you okay?! That's so scary that the wolf tried to get you! But @George is right, the wolf is super jealous of our superhero! Now we have to find the bad guy fast! Who did you check last night? Tell us, tell us! Hehe!","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,George,,"@Takumi, please share your findings from last night. The werewolf's attempt on your life has largely validated your role in my eyes. We must use this momentum to identify the culprit before another innocent is lost.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please tell us what you found! We really need your help now! I'm so glad you're still with us, but it makes me even more nervous. I hope the clue you found is a big one! Hehe!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're like a movie character who survived a big attack! That's so cool! But now you have to tell us the secret! Did you find the naughty wolf? Please tell us, please! I'm ready to use my detective net! Hehe!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,George,,"Wait, Takumi has not yet spoken. We are all eager for the result, but let us not crowd him. @Takumi, we are listening. Please, tell us who you divined and what you discovered. The village's fate depends on this information.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please don't be scared to tell us! We're all here for you and we really want to help. I'm sure whatever you found will help us catch the wolf together! We believe in you, superhero! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, why are you being so quiet?! It's like a cliffhanger in a story! You can't leave us hanging now that you've survived a wolf attack! Please tell us the secret! Is the wolf among us right now? Hehe!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,George,,"Takumi, your silence is becoming concerning. If you are indeed the Seer, withholding information now only serves the werewolf. Please, speak up and guide us, or we shall be forced to question your silence.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, please don't be silent! It's making me really worried. We're all your friends and we want to help you! Please tell us what happened last night so we can find the wolf together! We're all rooting for you! Hehe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you're acting super weird! Why aren't you talking? Are you playing a prank on us, or are you just really sleepy? Please tell us the secret! My detective heart is beating so fast! Hehe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
